    <briefdescription>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Exception type thrown by checker routines when validation fails.</para>
<para>The error message can be augmented after construction with AppendContext() so that callers higher in the recursion can prepend contextual information (such as the offending node or graph) to the underlying error string. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
